---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../content/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy">
  <div class="wrap page-head prose" style="max-width:760px">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="notice">Draft for review. Have an attorney confirm it against POPIA before launch.</p>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>{site.legalName} ("True Tag") runs this website and product verification service. Contact: {site.email}.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you check a code we record the time, the channel (web, WhatsApp stub, SMS stub or API), the verdict, a hashed IP address, an optional coarse city if provided, and a truncated user-agent. We do not ask for your name to check a product.</p>
    <p>If you send a pilot request, report a fake, claim a reward stub or email us, we use the details you give to reply to you and (for reports) to inform the brand that owns the code.</p>
    <h2>Why</h2>
    <p>To give you a verdict, to help brands spot counterfeit activity, to rate-limit abuse, and to improve the service.</p>
    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>Brands see scan results and consumer reports for their own products. They do not receive your hashed IP. We share information with authorities only where the law requires it.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may ask us to see, correct or delete your personal information by emailing {site.email}.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
